Why is that?

00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,040
Well, because cancer can change.

00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:34,040
And that is not that uncommon actually.

00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,040
So it's still breast cancer.

00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:40,040
It's still metastasized from the original primary tumor site.

00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:47,040
But it's how it's responding to hormones is differently.

